  setupInstructions: `Choose Full profile for the complete configuration, or Unit frames only for the unit frame features without the other EQoL settings.

To import Unit frames only:
1. Run /eqol
2. Profiles -> EQoL Unit Frames
3. Import the Unit frames only string

This addon does a ton of different things that could replace a lot of different extra addons/WAs:

- Party/raid frames with edit-mode support
- UI Fading
- Teleport UI for m+, portals and other teleport tools
- Hold to release
- Spell/Item IDs
- Auto accept/turnin quests (Leatrix plus)
- Auto repair/sell junk (Leatrix plus)
- Auto combat logging in raids/mythic+
- Pull timers
- Auto "delete" confirmation (Leatrix plus)
- Group finder filters
- Raider.IO/m+ rating on tooltips
- Smart healthpot/healthstone/food/water macro
`,
